            "description_html": "<b>4-1/2\" x 4\" x Square Corners Brushed Stainless Steel Hinge</b>\r\n<p>Heavy duty solid stainless steel commercial grade door hinge with 2 ball bearings. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global CS4540BB-US32D Stainless Steel Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\"</li>\r\n<li>Ball Bearings: 2BB</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12  x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>2 Ball Bearings for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>US32D <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b> Finish</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Hinge Pin</li>\r\n<li>Conforms to ANSI A5112 for Stainless Steel Bearing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with Stainless Steel machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood  doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>**Item discontinued use <a href=\"/products/4-5-x-4-stainless-steel-commercial-door-hinge-2-ball-bearings-and-non-removable-pin\">GLO-CS4540BBNRP-US32D</a>\r\n</b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
